.TH PSYC-CC 1 2025-01-20 "PsyC 0.9.5" "PsyC Manual"

.SH NAME
psyc\-cc \- build C code by linking PsyC library

.SH SYNOPSIS
Usage: psyc\-cc [OPTIONS] [SOURCE] [\-- GCC_OPTS]

.SH DESCRIPTION
Compile a C source file against Psyc library.



.SH OPTIONS



.TP

.B --is-lib
Compile a library instead of an executable


.TP

.B --cflags
Print CFLAGS and exit


.TP

.B --ldflags
Print LDFLAGS and exit


.TP

.B --c++
SOURCE is a C++ source


.TP

.B -o, --output  PATH
Output path


.TP

.B -s, --static
Use static library


.TP

.B -p, --dry-run
Only print command whithout executing it


.TP

.B -q, --quiet
Quiet mode


.TP

.B -h, --help
Print this help




